   "announcedAt": "2024-10-26T02:55:51.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'm just writing a quick announcement to let you know I've uploaded a new build of the game. This build should fix a technical issue which prevented the music from being played properly during the opening scenes of the VN.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I've also fixed a couple of typos which were found in the English script, and I fixed a bug which prevented players from swapping back to the Spanish language option in the preferences screen after initially selecting a language.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, thank you to everybody for pointing these issues out. It's appreciated! If you find more issues in the game, do let me know, and I will try to fix everything in a timely manner.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ebi x",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
